{"2276500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Portal Guardians", "steam_appid": 2276500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Portal Guardians</strong> won't make you bored!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276500/extras/e96f29831f3d7ce301d37ee97aa887d5.poster.avif?t=1782231358\" width=532 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276500/extras/e96f29831f3d7ce301d37ee97aa887d5.webm?t=1782231358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276500/extras/e96f29831f3d7ce301d37ee97aa887d5.mp4?t=1782231358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alone or with a friend. Use a varied arsenal of weapons and traps to stop the waves of enemies! Portals have opened around the world, close them soon!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276500/extras/b79153e764c805ed24e514994673b09d.poster.avif?t=1782231358\" width=532 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276500/extras/b79153e764c805ed24e514994673b09d.webm?t=1782231358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276500/extras/b79153e764c805ed24e514994673b09d.mp4?t=1782231358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go through story scenarios using all the power of your weapons in your arsenal and setting various traps on various places (walls, floors and ceilings). Improve your arsenal, with each level of improvement, the strength of your weapons will increase, and the power of traps will increase. Restore world order by protecting the portals while they close, don't let the monsters get there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276500/extras/7928f57a28f30159dd9ace1e225a87e9.poster.avif?t=1782231358\" width=532 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276500/extras/7928f57a28f30159dd9ace1e225a87e9.webm?t=1782231358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2276500/extras/7928f57a28f30159dd9ace1e225a87e9.mp4?t=1782231358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Campaign</strong> - Fight hordes of enemies and uncover the mysterious force behind these attacks.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op</strong> - Two brave heroes are at your disposal.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadly Weapons</strong> - Several weapon types with unique properties and characteristics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traps of Death</strong> - A wide selection of traps that can be placed on walls, floors, and ceilings. These traps will help you wipe out enemy hordes, so don’t forget to upgrade them!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dangerous Enemies</strong> - Foes with their own traits and stats! Choose your weapons and traps wisely!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong> - Improve weapons and traps as you progress through the campaign.</p></li></ul